## Before creating or changing an endpoint

Read: the feature `feature.md`, `docs/mhp/business-logic.md`, `docs/mhp/data-model.md`, `docs/rules/workflow-api-endpoint.md`.

## REST and routes

- Methods: GET (read), POST (create), PATCH (update), DELETE (delete).
- Plural resources; predictable paths. Handlers under `src/app/api/{resource}/route.ts`.

## Validation

- Zod schemas for **all** inputs. Do not leak internal DB structure in responses.

## Auth (Clerk)

- Clerk session where required. **Admin** operations (stock, prices, orders, reporting): authenticated user **and** authorized per `feature.md` and `business-logic.md`.

## Multi-tenant / context

- ARPG scope: filter and validate by **game/catalog** per rules; do not assume per-store `storeId`. Do not mix contexts when forbidden.

## Layers (reinforcement)

- Route → Service → Repository only. Repository: data access only; Service: rules and orchestration.

## Quick checklist

- [ ] Zod at the boundary
- [ ] Thin handler
- [ ] Logic in service
- [ ] Prisma only in repository
- [ ] Auth/authorization for admin
- [ ] JSON in standard data/error shape